{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も１日お疲れ様です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日で2ndシングル「BAN」のミーグリが\n全て終了致しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さん、\nありがとうございました‪‪☺︎‬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"直接お会い出来ない寂しさがありつつも、\n皆さんとオンラインで繋がれる事が\n嬉しいな、幸せだな、と改めて感じました☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画面越しでお手紙を読んでくださる方、\n花束をくださる方もいらっしゃって、\n皆さんの優しさと愛にも凄く心が温まりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はあまりお話が上手ではないので、\n皆さんを困らせてしまったかと思いますが\n少しでも皆さんにとっての日頃の癒しの時間になっていたら、と思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また皆さんにお会い出来る日を\n楽しみにしています。‪‪☺︎‬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日と今日のお洋服と髪型🌷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12日\nスカーフを巻いてみました‪‪☺︎‬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカーフを見せたかったので、\n久しぶりにポニーテールにしてみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JTFTHCV9MTHA95K15SDDXH4B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JTFTHF2VTY3DZVG8P78VAXWG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JTFTHGTP040Q9SFZ85W28H40","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカーフ、折り方難しいな。🤔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13日\n黒いシャツのワンピースを着てみました‪‪☺︎‬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JTFTHJF9438QXP4RF5Y5SB34","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JTFTHM3ZC4M1ZEH9XDGQYPPQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段着ないようなお洋服を着たので\nヘアアレンジが思いつかず、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部と2部の髪型は\nはぶちゃんに考案してもらいました‪‪☺︎‬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうね、はぶちゃん～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JTFTHNGWEPBED4Z769KRVW92","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい妹🦒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近甘えてくれる頻度が\n増えた気がする、嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部と4部は初挑戦。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JTFTHQ4Q8JSAZ5D9WZKXA6CC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JTFTHRMR4JZ9JWC8XWF1SA2N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かきあげ?でこだし?\nんー、分からん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JTFTHT4539K72CTHXTAKPBVY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JTFTHVKKSPAG7ZYQVZSV1G7F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆいちゃんに\n「いいじゃん、でこだし」と、\nさり気なく言って貰えて凄い嬉しかった😳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルになってから初めて\n前髪をセンター分けにしたり、\nおでこを全開にしたりしました‪‪☺︎‬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪をおろすことは自分にとって\n譲れないものだったので\nおでこを出すことに対して\n今まで躊躇していたのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日おでこを出してみて\nずっとソワソワしたり、\n不安な気持ちでいつつも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか一つまた自分の中の大きなものを\nいい意味で壊したような感覚がしていて\n少し爽快感があります。☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頻繁にはやりませんが、\nまたいつかどこかでやろうかな…?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みい。"}],"source":"archive"}